    "title": "Board cites 'serious misconduct' in firing of Cinema Arts Centre founder's son - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karina Kovac ,\n8 hours ago The son of the founder of the Huntington Cinema Arts Centre has been ousted from his leadership role after the theater said it uncovered \"serious misconduct.\" The Cinema Arts Centre issued a press release Wednesday addressing the departure of co-director Dylan Skolnick, whose parents, Vic Skolnick and Charlotte Sky, founded the beloved independent cinema in 1973. Read full article",
